#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-configure.rst:37
#: 808a3c9c751049ba97f3b1365cfd5d30
msgid "3) Additional Parameter Configuration"
msgstr "3) 其他参数配置"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-configure.rst:38
#: f8d73aa9679d4d9eb5f956105c631dab
msgid "The following parameters must be set to these specified values:"
msgstr "以下参数必须设置为指定值："

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-configure.rst:40
#: 07d7b23f228c4b249d8ec1d783aac1c8
msgid ""
":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 3 (For firmware to recognize vehicle as "
"Balance Bot)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 3（使固件将车辆识别为平衡机器人）"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-configure.rst:41
#: 348e68a61ae942ae84258433242d8c8b
msgid ":ref:`MOT_SLEWRATE<MOT_SLEWRATE>` = 0 (Do not account for motor slew)"
msgstr ":ref:`MOT_SLEWRATE<MOT_SLEWRATE>` = 0（不计电机斜率限制）"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-configure.rst:42
#: 834344ca7b31440ca979c08fe93bb54b
msgid ":ref:`FS_CRASH_CHECK<FS_CRASH_CHECK>` = 1 (Enable Crash Check)"
msgstr ":ref:`FS_CRASH_CHECK<FS_CRASH_CHECK>` = 1（启用碰撞检测）"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-configure.rst:47
#: 40e1f467b619409fb916529c8d82a7c2
msgid "4) Minimum Throttle"
msgstr "4) 最小油门"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-configure.rst:48
#: 7b4e135cd7d2411c9cc521c4c8178433
msgid ""
"Many motors and ESCs have a dead zone. This is the zone between the zero "
"throttle value and the throttle value at which the motor starts to move. "
"This can be compensated by setting minimum throttle in the firwamre."
msgstr "许多电机和电调存在死区，即从零油门到电机开始转动的油门值之间的区域。可通过在固件中设置最小油门来补偿此死区。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-configure.rst:50
#: d0ebef0a9a9340669784b23522e13e07
msgid "Remove wheels before proceeding"
msgstr "操作前请先拆除车轮"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-configure.rst:52
#: d1b43e9b561e47029307b0363ca4b41e
msgid ""
"To fix the dead zone, open the motor test window in Mission Planner, as "
"mentioned :ref:`here<rover-motor-and-servo-configuration-testing>`.  Find "
"the minimum throttle value at which the motor turns on and set the parameter"
" :ref:`MOT_THR_MIN<MOT_THR_MIN>` to that value. Now the motor should start "
"at 1% throttle."
msgstr ""
"要消除死区，请在 Mission Planner 中打开电机测试窗口（如 :ref:`此处 <rover-motor-and-servo-"
"configuration-testing>` 所述）。找到电机启动时的最小油门值，并将参数 "
":ref:`MOT_THR_MIN<MOT_THR_MIN>` 设置为该值。此后电机应在 1% 油门时启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-configure.rst:55
#: 8b1b566c34064eae9c2041a6aec90778
msgid "5) Arming"
msgstr "5) 解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-configure.rst:56
#: bce4983c3f364ab1ad61b9ef547f4d3c
msgid ""
"The vehicle must be armed for the wheels to start moving. Check the "
":ref:`rover arming page<arming-your-rover>` for more details."
msgstr "车轮开始转动前必须先解锁车辆。详情请查看 :ref:`Rover 解锁页面 <arming-your-rover>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-configure.rst:58
#: f7b8d8b3667c4e02940b76594cd8351c
msgid ""
"This is simply an arming test. The vehicle will have to be tuned before it "
"is ready to run."
msgstr "这只是一个解锁测试。车辆在正式运行前还需要进行调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-configure.rst:60
#: 9dedb7dec6e34a0e912958fc540ef117
msgid "Remove wheels before proceeding."
msgstr "操作前请先拆除车轮。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-configure.rst:62
#: 344753fa799f498c83800f446ab2e10d
msgid ""
"Set a :ref:`transmitter switch<common-auxiliary-functions>` for arming. "
"Ensure the channel used for the switch has been :ref:`calibrated<common-"
"radio-control-calibration>`. To configure a channel for arming, for example "
"channel 7, then set the parameter:"
msgstr ""
"设置一个用于解锁的 :ref:`遥控器开关 <common-auxiliary-functions>`。确保该开关所用通道已完成 :ref:`校准 "
"<common-radio-control-calibration>`。例如将通道 7 配置为解锁通道，则设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-configure.rst:64
#: 42a99dbfb11142c6abf4897450cc2b13
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_OPTION<RC7_OPTION>` =41 (Sets function of channel 7 as "
"arming/disarming)"
msgstr ":ref:`RC7_OPTION<RC7_OPTION>` = 41（将通道 7 功能设置为解锁/上锁）"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-configure.rst:66
#: b7ee1598aed743a6a0a27e73349210c8
msgid ""
"Connect the battery. Connect the autopilot board to GCS via USB or "
"telemetry."
msgstr "连接电池，通过 USB 或数传将飞控板连接到 GCS。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-configure.rst:68
#: 06f5226b99414e2dbefee4d69c4638e6
msgid ""
"Keep the vehicle upright and then arm it. If arming is not successful check "
"the error message on the GCS and identify the problem from the :ref:`rover "
"arming page<arming-your-rover>`."
msgstr ""
"保持车辆竖直，然后进行解锁。若解锁不成功，请检查地面站上的错误消息，并参照 :ref:`Rover 解锁页面 <arming-your-rover>` "
"查明问题原因。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-configure.rst:70
#: b622b59aa3fb4928a12d3d1959477aab
msgid ""
"After the vehicle arms, pitch it forward and back manually(Use hands, not "
"the RC transmitter). The motors must turn in the direction of pitch."
msgstr "车辆解锁后，用手（而非遥控器）前后俯仰车辆。电机必须向俯仰方向转动。"

#: ../../source/docs/balance_bot-configure.rst:72
#: 0e4ca1a7973644b9b4984ddc0f1688e5
msgid ""
"Proceed to the :ref:`Control Modes<balance_bot-modes>` and "
":ref:`tuning<balance_bot-tuning>` section if the above steps were "
"successful."
msgstr ""
"若以上步骤成功，请继续前往 :ref:`控制模式 <balance_bot-modes>` 和 :ref:`调参 <balance_bot-"
"tuning>` 章节。"
